# recovery.fstab — AIO LIVE placeholder (intentionally empty).
# The stub-time swap (aioswap.c, post LGZ unpack, pre init) replaces this
# file with families/<fam>/recovery.fstab for the detected device BEFORE
# anything parses it. There are deliberately NO zuma defaults here: if
# you read this text in a booted image, the swap did not run.
# Swap kit: system/etc/recovery.fstab.<fam> (shipped alongside).
